meta-brax
=========

Machines for Brax Technologies handsets.

  brax3        BraX3 running BaseOS 1.0
  brax3-iode   BraX3 running iodeOS (what the phone ships with)

  MediaTek Dimensity 6300 (MT6835), 6.56" 720x1612 panel, GKI android13-5.15
  (MediaTek mgk), boot + init_boot (header v4). The two machines differ only
  in the kernel release string their stock vendor modules require; the
  shared settings are in conf/machine/include/brax3.inc.

Like meta-zinwa's q25 and meta-google's bluejay and panther, this layer builds
only the *boot images*. The rootfs is the generic halium-arm64 one and the GSI
is chosen at install time, so there is no brax3 image recipe and no brax3
package feed - anything that would need one is a porting bug. See
conf/machine/include/brax3.inc.

Kernel and device sources: https://git.os-source.co (Brax3_BaseOs).

Layer dependencies: core, openembedded-layer, android-layer (meta-android).
